'''Christmas D.''' (ナカイサンタ, ''Nakai Santa'') is a [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] variant of [[Rain D.]] that appears in [[Special Events|Event Stages]]. It was added in [[Version 4.5 Update|Version 4.5]]. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], it was added in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]].

